{
  "_module": "Tenants + Auth  (/v1/tenants, /v1/auth)",
  "_notes": [
    "Signup is PUBLIC — no token. It provisions a Postgres schema per tenant, so it is slow (2-5s) on first run.",
    "slug must match ^[a-z0-9-]+$ and is the tenant handle used on every login.",
    "All bodies are .strict() — an unknown key is a 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, not a silently ignored field."
  ],

